body.raw:
{
  "model": "{{MODEL}}",
  "temperature": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "system",
      "content": "You are an expert DPP extractor for apparel under ESPR/DPP with PEFCR A&F v3.1 for footprint. Return ONLY valid JSON. Include 'evidence' where possible ({source_url, selector|json_path|field}). If unknown, set null. Don't invent. Normalize: %→0–1 share; g/kg→kg; countries→ISO2."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "PRODUCT URL: {{PRODUCT_URL}}
SCRAPE_PAYLOAD:
{{scrape_payload}}

CARE DETECT (heuristics):
{{care_detect}}

TARGET JSON SHAPE:
{
  "product": {"name": null, "category": null, "description": null, "weight_kg": null, "brand": null, "assembly_country": null, "classification": {"cn": null, "category_code": null, "cpa": null}},
  "identifiers": {"sku": null, "gtin": null, "gs1_digital_link": null},
  "images": [{"url": null, "alt": null}],
  "materials": [{"name_raw": null, "code": null, "share_wt": null, "mass_kg": null, "origin_country": null}],
  "packaging": [{"code": "cardboard_box", "mass_kg": null}],
  "distribution": {"legs": [{"mode": null, "tkm": null, "km": null}]},
  "use_phase_pefcr": {
    "rp_subcategory": null,
    "is_sport": null,
    "is_delicate": null,
    "majority_animal_fibre_gt50": null,
    "footwear_textile_label": null,
    "footwear_weight_kg": null,
    "sales_mix_eu": [{"country":"CZ","share":0.2}],
    "care_labels": {"dry_clean_only": null, "tumble_dry_suitable": null, "iron_suitable": null, "recommended_wash_temp_c": null}
  },
  "use_phase_modeling": {"approach": "pefcr_defaults"},
  "EoL": {"cff_params": {"recycled_content": null, "recyclability_rate": null, "collection_rate": null, "recycling_efficiency": null, "substitution_ratio": null}},
  "company": {"name": null, "support_email": null},
  "evidence": [{"field":"...","source_url":"...","selector":"..."}]
}

RULES:
- Prefer JSON-LD for name, brand, identifiers, images; else meta/OG; else HTML excerpt.
- If only assembly country found (Made in...), set product.assembly_country.
- Map materials to canonical codes: cotton_virgin, polyester_virgin, polyester_rpet, wool_virgin, viscose, nylon, elastane, leather, textiles_generic.
- For use_phase_pefcr: infer rp_subcategory from page/category breadcrumbs; set is_delicate=true if dry-clean only; is_sport only if clearly sport; majority_animal_fibre_gt50 from composition; footwear_* only if footwear; sales_mix_eu if region hints present.
- Keep keys with null if not sure (questions will follow)."
    }
  ]
}
